      "type": "MARKDOWN",
      "source": "# Python 301 · Standard Library & Functional\n\nPython ships with a huge standard library — no install needed. This lesson tours the most useful modules and functional-style tools.\n\n**Prerequisites:** *Python 201*.",
      "output": "",
      "executionCount": 0
